  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit customer support. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please wait while we connect you to an agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031092000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 94395,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031101666666
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is Charlie. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031102466666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 94395,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031108799999
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. To get started, can I have your name and order number please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031110799999
    },
    {
      "text": "Alex Bell. Order number is 78-554-12.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 94395,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031117199999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Alex. I have your order right here for the Velo Carbon cycling shoes. What specifically is the issue with them?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031119866665
    },
    {
      "text": "They don't work for me. They cause problems.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 94395,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031128199998
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear that. To understand better, is it a technical fault with the cleats or more of a sizing or comfort preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031131333331
    },
    {
      "text": "They give me blisters. So I guess you could call that a comfort issue. A painful one.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 94395,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031140066664
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, that's definitely not the experience we want for our riders. I see here that the shoes were delivered 44 days ago. Let me just confirm our policy.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031145933330
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sure you will.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 94395,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031156133330
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, thank you for your patience. It looks like you're well within our 90-day return window for standard items. I can absolutely process a full refund for these cycling shoes. No problem at all.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031157533330
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. So what do I do?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 94395,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031170733330
    },
    {
      "text": "I have just sent a pre-paid return shipping label to the email we have on file. Just print that out, attach it to the box, and drop it off at any post office. Once our warehouse receives the shoes, we will issue the refund to your original payment method.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031172399996
    },
    {
      "text": "Guess I'll get that done then. Thanks.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 94395,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031189599996
    },
    {
      "text": "You're very welcome, Alex. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031192333329
    },
    {
      "text": "No, that's all.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 94395,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765031197733329
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright. Thank you for calling VeloFit, and I hope we can get you into a more comfortable pair of shoes in the future. Have a good day.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
